From 43057d1933400713df1786edb0f3ab2b844c8e8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 09:17:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Improve SEO, accessibility, and validity of the static site

Front-end-only improvements across the homepage and 22 product pages:

- Remove dead JavaScript (js/main.js, js/confirm.js) left over from an
  unrelated software-purchase assignment; main.js threw on every page load.
- Fix HTML validity: set lang="vi" (content is Vietnamese), replace bare
  <ul> bullets with proper <li> items, convert reused id="machines_link"/
  "sub_machines_link"/"maysaytangsoi" to classes, and wrap loose <li> in
  lists. Add missing <!DOCTYPE> to several product pages.
- Per-page SEO: unique <title> and <meta description>, canonical link,
  Open Graph tags, and Organization JSON-LD on the homepage.
- Replace 22 malformed single-URL sitemap files with one valid sitemap.xml
  and add robots.txt.
- Accessibility: descriptive image alt text (was alt="Windows") and higher
  nav contrast (white on darker teal).
- Performance: lightweight PNG favicon, responsive header image, and
  loading="lazy" on product images.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MetpLcSbmZ64g35AebXbX5
